#: temp.glade:32885
msgid "SmallCaps"
msgstr "SmallCaps"

#: temp.glade:32906 temp.glade:33024
msgid "How much to raise the text (in pts)."
msgstr "ขนาดของข้อความ (ในป.ต.)"

#: temp.glade:32933
